@startuml sequence_scrubber_update
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Scrubber Moves the Date

participant "Review Scrubber" as Scrub
participant DashboardModeService as Mode
participant TileContext as Ctx
participant ReviewGoalHistoryController as Ctrl
participant GoalProgressService as Svc
participant "Commitments.Api" as Api

Scrub -> Mode: setSelectedReviewDate('2026-03-15')
Mode --> Ctx: signal change
Ctx --> Ctrl: effect fires
Ctrl -> Svc: getAt(goalId, '2026-03-15T23:59:59Z')\n(switchMap drops in-flight call)
Svc -> Api: GET /at
Api --> Svc: GoalProgressDto
Svc --> Ctrl: historical
Ctrl -> Ctrl: delta recompute

@enduml
